<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Scoped lint exceptions.

    The rule for this file: an entry here names one issue at one path, with the
    evidence for why lint is wrong about that path. Nothing is disabled
    globally, and nothing goes in here because it was inconvenient to fix — a
    real finding gets fixed instead. There is no lint baseline file in this
    project, deliberately: a baseline hides today's findings from tomorrow.
-->
<lint>

    <!--
        ObsoleteSdkInt is correct in general and wrong here.

        It reasons that with minSdkVersion 26 a `-v26` qualifier can never
        change which folder is chosen, which is true. But renaming the folder to
        the bare `mipmap-anydpi` it recommends makes AGP's resource merger drop
        it altogether: the files never reach `packaged_res`, and the build fails
        at resource-link time with

            AAPT: error: resource mipmap/ic_launcher not found

        That was reproduced on this project, twice, before this entry was
        written. Scoped to the one folder so the check keeps working everywhere
        else — including on any density folder someone adds later.
    -->
    <issue id="ObsoleteSdkInt">
        <ignore path="src/main/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26" />
    </issue>

</lint>
